'''Never Not Summer!''' (だって超夏じゃニャーイ！''Datte Chō Natsu Ja Nyāi!'', '''Cause It's Nyat Super-Summer!''') is the July [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and [[The Battle Cats]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[Selena]], a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Sunny Celeboodle]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

==Event==
The continued story of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Never Summer!'''}} appears in The Battle Cats Legend Stages!!!<br>
Across the white sands, an arrogant voice echoes: "Make way, I've reserved this entire beach as my private tanning spot!!!"

A new enemy appears, and she'll crush anyone who gets between her and the perfect summer skintone.<br>
Head to Legend Stages during this event to take on the new Special Stage map {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Never Not Summer!"'''}}<br>
Can you defeat the starring enemy {{Color|#FF0000|'''Selena'''}}, or will she bully you right off the beach?<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available July 16th (11:00pm) thru August 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock Vacation Queen upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a 100% chance to collect rewards by using the Treasure Radar item!)

※ After you have picked up Vacation Queen, unlock it at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Vacation Queen from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

Clear the stage to earn a new class of Lucky Tickets, the coveted "Lucky Tickets G"! Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in Never Not Summer! will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!

※Never Not Summer is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Never Not Summer!" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option!<br>
Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G!'''}}

※ If you own any Lucky Tickets G, the banner option to use them at the Cat Tickets menu will appear, whether an event that provides them is available or not.<br>
※ Collected Lucky Tickets G will not be lost even after the event you earned them from has ended.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G option does not appear in the Cat Capsules, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

